      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T09:31:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not related to this CL.\nThe logic is not really aligned with NetworkMonitorUtils#isValidationRequired.\nWill we have issue for some corner cases? e.g. mayValidated is true, but actually the network doesn\u0027t require validation.\nIt is unlikely to me since this is just score of prospective network.",
